FORM ALV_TOOLBAR  USING    PE_OBJECT
                                TYPE REF TO CL_ALV_EVENT_TOOLBAR_SET
                           PE_INTERACTIVE
                           PV_SENDER.
  DATA: LS_TOOLBAR TYPE STB_BUTTON.

*  CLEAR LS_TOOLBAR.
*  LS_TOOLBAR-BUTN_TYPE = '3'.
*  LS_TOOLBAR-DISABLED = SPACE.
*  APPEND LS_TOOLBAR TO PE_OBJECT->MT_TOOLBAR.
*
*  CLEAR LS_TOOLBAR.
